# # /moca/
#
# Permanent identifiers for OpenMOCA, an open standard for packaging digital
# works with their credits, sources and the creator's terms: JSON Schemas
# (/moca/schemas/), profiles (/moca/profiles/) and attestation statement types
# (/moca/attestation/).
#
# https://w3id.org/moca/ and everything under it redirects to the same path on
# https://openmoca.org/, except attestation types, which redirect to the page
# that defines them.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# OpenMOCA
# hello@openmoca.org
# GitHub username: petecleary

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^attestation/ https://openmoca.org/spec/attestations/ [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://openmoca.org/$1 [R=302,L]
